   {
    "id": "p_00042",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     57,
     1
    ],
    "text": "First released in Issue 6. Derived from the XNS, Issue 5.2 specification.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00043",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     57,
     3
    ],
    "text": "The [B53]restrict[/B53] keyword is added to the [I54]getsockopt[/I54]() prototype for alignment with the ISO/IEC&nbsp;9899:1999\nstandard.",
    "placeholders": {
     "B53": {
      "open": "<b>",
      "close": "</b>",
      "translate": true
     },
     "I54": {
      "open": "<i>",
      "close": "</i>",
      "translate": true
     }
    },
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "p_00044",
    "type": "p",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     57,
     5
    ],
    "text": "IEEE&nbsp;Std&nbsp;1003.1-2001/Cor&nbsp;2-2004, item XSH/TC2/D6/47 is applied, updating the description of SO_LINGER in the\nDESCRIPTION so that it blocks the calling thread rather than the process.",
    "placeholders": {},
    "context": null
   },
   {
    "id": "h4_00045",
    "type": "h4",
    "path": [
     2,
     3,
     59
    ],
